# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist-ssr
*.local

# dist/ is deliberately NOT ignored. `go install ...@latest` builds from the
# module proxy, which serves only committed files, and //go:embed needs the
# built assets present at compile time. CI runs `git diff --exit-code dist/`
# so a stale bundle cannot ship.

